'''Chapters''' are sets of '''floors''' (or '''stages''') containing similar [[enemy|enemies]], themes, [[boss]]es, and difficulties. Earlier chapters are divided into three floors, while later chapters contain one floor. Each chapter has different '''environments''' (or '''stage types''') which, while retaining similar feels, have slightly different themes, enemies, bosses, and difficulties. Each environment also has its own [[music]].

